                <pb facs="0262" n="174" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg174"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.G1A/306: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chairman of the
                        American Delegation</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hull</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-10T17:00:00-05:00">December 10, 1933—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>64. Your 41, December 9, 4 p.m. The President agrees that there is no objection
                    to your offering the resolution convening the Third Pan American Financial
                    Conference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
